sweetherdr

This repository contains files derived from the Herdr app (https://herdr.dev),
version 0.1.15, which is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The following mods began as copies of mods and screens that ship with the
Herdr app, and have been changed:

  mods/sweetagents      from Herdr's  mods/agents
  mods/sweetchanges     from Herdr's  mods/changes
  mods/sweetchrome      from Herdr's  mods/workspace-chrome
  mods/sweetfiles       from Herdr's  mods/files
  mods/sweetmenu        from Herdr's  mods/menu
  mods/sweetnewmenu    from Herdr's  mods/new-menu
  mods/sweetpane        from Herdr's  mods/pane
  mods/sweetsettings    from Herdr's  frame/settings
  mods/sweetspaces      from Herdr's  mods/spaces
  mods/sweetstatus      from Herdr's  mods/workspace-status
  mods/sweettabs        from Herdr's  mods/tabs

layouts/sweetherdr.json began as a copy of Herdr's layouts/main.json.

Changes made to them: square or 2px corners, lowercase labels, list rows that
highlight from edge to edge, an uncommitted-changes count per space, projects
that group spaces, buttons for sweetherdr's own tabs and panels in the tab bar,
and frames drawn by the mods themselves for menus and dialogs.

The remaining mods (sweetboard, sweetsim, sweetsimscreen, sweetskills,
sweettasks, sweettimeline) were written for this layout.

Ideas taken from community layouts, none of whose code is included, are
credited in CREDITS.md.

Icons

Most .svg icons in the mods copied from Herdr came with those mods and are
from Lucide (https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide), some of them derived from
Feather. The icons drawn for this layout are phone.svg, tasks.svg, send.svg,
plus.svg (in sweettasks), timeline.svg, skills.svg and board.svg.

